==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*tropa}}. Akin to {{m|ru|трепа́ть}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|grc|τρίβος}} (< {{m|grc|τρίβω}} << {{m+|ine-pro|*terh₁-}}, whence also {{m|ru|тере́ть}}). Also compare {{m|ru|доро́га}} (akin to {{m|ru|дёргать}}, {{m|ru|драть}}). Also compare {{m+|la|rupta via}} (whence {{m|ru|ра́ут}}, {{m|ru|рути́на}}, etc.).

